	(text "NUCLEO-F446RE: JP5 on E5V, 5V from PS1 into CN7-6. 3V3 from on-board regulator (CN7-16).\nOn-board only: PA2/PA3 ST-LINK VCP, PA5 LD2, PC13 B1, PA13/PA14 SWD, PH0/PH1 HSE, PC14/PC15 LSE." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 345.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "96da5815-41ed-53e0-b1c9-99f2c5f7a4e1"))
	(text "I2C3: SPS30 SEL=GND (I2C, 0x69); BME680 SDO=3V3 (0x77), CS=3V3. 4k7 pull-ups to 3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 355.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a9a631de-7330-5bdd-80f4-389c338d9bd5"))
	(text "5V outputs -> 1k8 (series) / 3k3 (to GND) divider -> 3.24V max at MCU pin:\nMQ131 AO -> PA0, MiCS RED -> PA1, MiCS NOX -> PA7, RobotDyn Z-C -> PC6." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 363.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e34b45f5-8bd6-54b7-8c5f-1c5a6aeaee88"))
	(text "220VAC mains split: J1 -> RobotDyn TRIAC (fan) and PS1 AC-DC (12V buzzer, 5V board + peripherals).\nPS1 pins: 1 L, 2 N, 3 +12V, 4 +5V, 5 GND.  USART3 (future Arduino link): PB10 TX / PC5 RX." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 373.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0d0dcd23-fc8c-5b93-bcd9-33721b9e4758"))
	(text "Buzzer: R9 input left floating (GPIO not assigned in clearair.ioc). Q3 inverts:\ninput HIGH -> buzzer OFF; LOW/floating -> R16 pulls IRFZ44N gate to 12V -> buzzer ON." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6be01d1e-dbd8-5012-83a7-2a1cb0928acd"))
	(text "HIGH VOLTAGE: J1, PS1 pins 1-2, RobotDyn IN/N/OUT, M1 carry 220VAC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 406.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c0a00487-1871-51c3-9809-e1ffe800fe3b"))
